%% Init → Spec Flow (Iteration 97)
%% Shows the new seamless flow from init through diagram scaffolding to spec

flowchart TD
    subgraph Init["gig:init"]
        A[Step 0: Guard Check] --> B[Step 1: Scaffold .gig/]
        B --> C[Step 1b: Template Selection]
        C --> D{Project Type?}
        D -->|Content| E[Copy project file + diagram preset]
        D -->|Code| F[Copy diagram preset only]
        D -->|Skip| G[No diagrams]
        E --> H[Create .gig/design/ with .mmd files]
        F --> H
        G --> I[Steps 2-8: Discovery + State]
        H --> I
    end

    subgraph Spec["gig:spec (auto-launched)"]
        I --> J[Spec elicitation starts]
        J --> K[User stories + requirements]
    end

    subgraph Lifecycle["Diagram Evolution"]
        L[Init scaffolds preset] --> M[Gather updates in place]
        M --> N[Govern archives snapshot]
        N --> M
    end
